{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_title", "source_sha256": "f0225fee657ae8377d310014ac3f43fa5d350a6d074ecff124b497068c500e48", "ja": "美希とおでかけ2", "zh": "和美希一起出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "16888ddc21c16a291374a052ff5a2942d74e92926c4418288c62601780808dd2", "ja": "美希とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和美希外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "954a2b0d3c7c107bbf99df8fef03b5ed20d1db93add9a8ae74eb96f26f99656e", "ja": "（今日は久しぶりのオフ。頑張った美希のために、\nサーキット場にやってきた。すごい迫力だな！）", "zh": "（今天是久违的休息日。为了辛苦了的美希，我们来到了赛车场。真是气势十足啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "626a70be9b238a65036e738728897059ea1a1b60ddfcf093f8cf3c4b7c576f78", "ja": "レーシングカー、すごい迫力だったの！\n車って、カッコイイんだね。ミキも運転してみたいな。", "zh": "赛车的气势真惊人啊！\n原来汽车这么帅气。美希也想试着开开看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ea8fc8a06edea052a5d6de952bb38e6bc2cdcb8e9f047543f14511e27bc7831a", "ja": "大人になったら免許をとって、運転してみるといい。\nあ、でも、事故には気を付けてほしいかな……。", "zh": "等长大了考到驾照，你可以试着开开看。\n啊，不过，还是希望你能多注意安全，别出事故啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "0dd97cf84ea6831b5784c5acd637cc2aaf9cdb7a0f3d56936780f0e19099b241", "ja": "ミキは、事故には遭わないと思うよ？\n絶対、大丈夫なの！", "zh": "美希觉得，自己应该不会遇到事故吧？\n绝对没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5282176e50dfd3e7d8ea68f04f5a113ed47584d888c679c2f180cf02093f011b", "ja": "こらこら。そういう甘い考えが一番危ないんだ。\n車は安全第一！　それだけは約束してくれ。", "zh": "喂喂，这种天真的想法才是最危险的。\n开车要把安全放在第一位！这一点你可一定要答应我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "c4b035c59875f6081b3b9f5b229ae5903e267d561c84b1177473abf75097ad38", "ja": "でもサーキットの車はビュンビュン飛ばしてるよ？", "zh": "可是赛车在赛道上都开得飞快啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "23ede0b2c430618417707929cd7e98cc52df3a0d333e4c66df140495bee659e4", "ja": "それはサーキットだからだ。大切な美希が事故になんか\n遭ったら、俺は悲しい……。すごく悲しいな……。", "zh": "那是因为在赛道上啊。要是我珍爱的美希出了什么事故，我会很难过……真的会很难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "395360ed7d26c4ea6a53842cb8fac8daf8ad13a3be1bd87182078a962c091b08", "ja": "えっ、……そ、そっか。じゃあ気を付ける。\nうん……ハニーがそう言うなら。", "zh": "诶，……这、这样啊。那我会小心的。\n嗯……既然哈尼都这么说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "33c0f13fec1e12bd5ad83f8ddfb4b26821918ff3ad6a1ab9e420d89b4b3678dc", "ja": "……えへへ。", "zh": "……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_003mik02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_003mik02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "db9892f09e51488e7733be9e0342139682c564bce19dfe377901f0794f117eef", "ja": "（その後の美希は、ずっと上機嫌だった。\n何はともあれ、安全運転を約束してくれて良かったな）", "zh": "（在那之后，美希一直都兴致高昂。总之，她愿意保证安全驾驶，真是太好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
